  "conditionalRules": [
    "SeparatorDecorative is decorative only; use ControlBorder when a boundary is necessary to perceive a control, state, or chart element.",
    "BrandContainer and neutral surfaces are not sufficient as the sole essential control or selection boundary; add ControlBorder or FocusRing plus a non-color cue.",
    "ControlBorder and FocusRing are validated against BrandContainer, but not against BrandPrimary. When focus touches BrandPrimary, offset the ring onto an audited neutral background or define and audit a separate two-tone treatment.",
    "Do not lower validated text colors with opacity. WCAG formally exempts inactive controls; TextDisabled deliberately preserves the text threshold as a stricter product policy and must be paired with a disabled control state or label.",
    "Do not place validated roles over images, gradients, materials, blur, or translucency without re-auditing the final composited pixels.",
    "Success, warning, danger, information, chart series, selection, and validation states require an icon, label, pattern, line style, or other non-color cue."
  ]
